{"id":1753,"bodyHtml":"<div><div><div data-page-id=\"GwnJdNlmwo1d0px8bTzccZWjnFb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><p>初夏逐梦，青春启航。6月12日上午8时30分，中北大学环境与安全工程学院2026届毕业典礼暨学位授予仪式在科艺苑隆重举行。院党委书记王振荣、院长曹雄、院党委副书记张少明、副院长张树海、副院长安崇伟，系主任、全体辅导员、班主任齐聚一堂，温情送别2026届全体毕业生，共同见证学子们圆满完成学业、整装奔赴人生崭新征程的重要时刻。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9o7VAVLmNiLzLaM14nfMRfRnNV2MzlmDLzfRMlCYn7r7M490gihFp2hmCIa0M1yZUYhRM1yDMzUZMzNbLmU4M87aMmvaUlnfnmUiL4vPozVFMNL8nlrknlrFoR98U4-Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/68CC665485992437A0670ADAF4537191/6C4EEBEE/884C2\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 712px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9LRVAkUlrVozT2M1mWfM8CYUz-sMmLm8MNW7LRCDU4AVLz90gihFp2hmCIa0Mkh2okhkUYhVo7MfL7UsLRUZL4GbnRC4U8nVLRCDU4-bLmWFLmQ7LlVkMNrFLmn2MznRgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></p></div><p></p><div data-page-id=\"GwnJdNlmwo1d0px8bTzccZWjnFb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><p>典礼在雄壮庄严的国歌声中正式启幕，铿锵旋律激荡着在场每一位师生的初心与热忱。院长曹雄发表毕业致辞。他全面回顾了学院近年来在学科建设、科研创新、人才培养等领域取得的丰硕成果与亮眼突破，细数了本届学子在校期间勤学笃行、奋勇拼搏的青春风采。同时，他向即将奔赴四方的全体毕业生寄予殷切厚望，嘱托大家始终心怀家国、坚守初心使命，勇于开拓创新、敢于攻坚克难，秉持脚踏实地的实干精神，在时代浪潮中锤炼本领、淬炼成长，以不懈奋斗实现人生价值，书写属于新时代青年的答卷。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MR9AbLR98M7L4U1NMfUzCsUzA2LmnmfnzviLzUPM4UYnmG0gihFp2hmCIa0U1h7MYyYMYyYLRlDLlVRnmCbnzMfoRUaMmMVUz-inNrVU8rFLNlPUz-4UzTFM8WRUm9Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/BD72720561ACF69E3A84063EA25FEECE/2E1A23A9/7BCB8\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 508px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9LmnARLRfVozMRU14AVM4-ioRr7UNVmVoRvZM7lPnRlZLlU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkyPUSyiL1hfL8CPnllYUmUso77iMRr7MR9Pn7Mkozv4MzVFMRnRozGPnRnFLlM2UmvagjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></p></div><p></p><p>随后，副院长张树海、安崇伟依次宣读学位授予名单与优秀毕业生表彰名单，现场领导为优秀毕业生颁发荣誉证书。教师代表曹卫国老师回顾学子成长历程，从心态、学习、处世三方面送上恳切叮嘱，并祝愿全体毕业生带着校训精神逐梦前行、前路坦荡。随后，博士毕业生代表武文瑜、硕士毕业生代表李浩嘉、本科毕业生代表刘耘菲相继发言，分享求学感悟与青春理想。</p><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9ozCAPn7C8U4vsL14Q7LRLbnRNiM8lm4MmNanNl4L8LbUzL0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yZokh2oSy4LlVkMlrRM49PL4AknllsM4GiLRTfnl7bUmMFMllDoln7M4nFMz-DU8-Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B88F931AB5EC78138BEE770509AEA9B3/5E69DD74/526CB\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9LzNA8oz9YnRAVM1mVVUzf2nlLZLRvmYoz7YL4NYLNLPnm70gihFp2hmCIa0UShknSy8LkhVnRNZUmlsU8rfUzG8M8liMNUiMR-YozGsn7rFMRQfUmNDn7nFLzfkUNQ2gjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9nllADnRCbnRlYU1mnkMmrkM4-4UN7m8oz-ZL7nfozAVnl70gihFp2hmCIa0USyDoShkn1ybU8LYM4NZMzNsozlPUmvaUlCYnmCbLmLaLRMFMmGYoz9aLNnFMzCiLm7Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/A69BF9CC2798597951B70AF2F6923003/6029802D/56521\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9LzrARL7rfnzGDn17VkMNLsU494o7Lm4U4linl-ZMmQRolC0gihFp2hmCIa0MYyaUSyYLYhfo7U4L8-bL4AfLRUPL4fRM7QfM4M2nl7bMzMFLR-PUmL4M7QFnllsozLJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><div data-page-id=\"GwnJdNlmwo1d0px8bTzccZWjnFb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><table bordercolor=\"transparent\" imgborderradius=\"0\"><tbody><tr><td><div draggable=\"true\">