=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></div></td><td><div draggable=\"true\"><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MN-AiM4CDLm6RU14-sL4UinR78UlnmkLRVRM4nVU4v4MzN0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyaLSysMkyPnz9PLRGPozl4LzGDnzNso7Lanl7ZM4AkUmrFLlliMll8olVFMz-iM8UJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" draggable=\"false\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C01741E81001953106E978C0EA878BB5/1E55E49A/5257D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MNLAPU8-DnmV2U1lC8L4LbMRMfo7lm8UmNYUzCZMmn7UmU0gihFp2hmCIa0MYy8MkhRLkhkU4Q7LR7PM7r7MzMkL4fVo7M7UmNaM4VfM8nFLRM2UlVkMzWFnmGbnRlJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></div></td></tr></tbody></table><p>学院党委书记王振荣作总结讲话。他立足中北大学红色兵工底蕴，勉励全体毕业生深耕红色根脉、传承兵工精神，在未来的工作与生活中持续锤炼过硬专业本领、永葆锐意进取的奋斗本色，立足岗位、实干担当，以青春之力扛起时代责任，勇敢奔赴时代新征程。仪式尾声，主席台就坐领导为全体毕业生授予学位并拨穗，庄重的仪式流程定格下专属毕业生的青春荣光，现场氛围温情满满、肃穆庄重。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9M4CADoRC8LmVRo1RCbollDU4NYn7UmsU4Q2UmvZLRM2Uz70gihFp2hmCIa0oShVLkyaMSyZLzGaMzTkLzl8MN-PMmAVnlCYMl7bUmnVLz6Fn7CsL8nfMlMFMNlaM49Jv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" vspace=\"0\" hspace=\"0\" alt=\"\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/9E005810059B1546B168EEF25A9B4E17/DF73DA5C/6E078\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 600px\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9Mm-ADL8V7Lmn2o1lLsL8-inlLiMz9m8Um7bMllPLmL4UmL0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyPMYyPLYyiUm6ko7QRL8LYUlUYLzr2oRvbLlM7nRVRLzVFLRA2MRTRMzWFLzT2MlLbgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UznA2LzGbUmW2U1z-8Ml7iLmAfoR7msUNCYnm62MmAfMRL0gihFp2hmCIa0UYy4L1yZoSy8LmC8U8WVnmfkMzrVLmQ2LmNsU8UZLm-8L4nFUN-aM8MVnRTFM8-PnzUJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C32894264CBEF0B55E26F297CD822434/BB07CED9/7B1E4\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 651px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9MRrA2UzUiL4A2M1lWRLRWRnRGYLNnmVnml8Ul78LzQfMlC0gihFp2hmCIa0MSyYM1y8U1ysUz9iL7UiLllYUmvDLl7ZM4G8MR94U4-aM4rFLlW7n7-8M4rFLlnfL77PgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></p></div><p>仪式落幕，毕业文艺表演温情上演。歌曲《篇章》《我们的明天》悠扬动听，诉说着青春故事与美好期许。学院党委副书记张少明、团委书记陈靓带来朗诵《中北的茶与月》，字句间饱含师生情谊与校园情怀，引得现场掌声不断。离别之际，全体辅导员登台合唱《祝你一路顺风》，婉转的歌声满载不舍与祝福，将现场氛围推向高潮。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UmUAYLzLDM4UYo1zU8ozfRLz9PUmNmYnm94MlQ7M8-YU4v0gihFp2hmCIa0LkhRMkyYn1yDUzlsLlVkoz-iU4C8o7lDnm7YMz9aM7lDU8MFL8LZMmTfnNVFMm67UNlJv2bjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0C42F6A571AB925C648E6F125804E6CC/3C869AFA/67DBE\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 606px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9n7LAZnlMVLz9sn1mCaMzA2o7Mknl-mbM8-aMz7sL4fRLRG0gihFp2hmCIa0LYysUYhfU1yZo7LYU4ARnR6kMlLbM4W7olCaM47aU4UDMNQFUl7sMNCsUNWFLlWfLRnkgjfJQ4Oeo4xwqjTAvShXptQ0g47aM4v0Lz78M4CJqdNnx&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.png\"></p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9Ll-AiMllaLmC8o1zf7ozn2MR98M4Nm4Mmf7oz9DL8CYLRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDnSyDL1yaozNbnm7ZUzG8ol7ZUz9YM4L8MlU4Mm9DMzMFUlLDU8Q7oRVFM8C4MNUJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.jpg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/B6E620999F18A049A8A827345D368653/AC6CFD81/7F36D\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 660px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9Ll-AiMllaLmC8o1zf7ozn2MR98M4Nm4Mmf7oz9DL8CYLRC0gihFp2hmCIa0U1yDnSyDL1yaozNbnm7ZUzG8ol7ZUz9YM4L8MlU4Mm9DMzMFUlLDU8Q7oRVFM8C4MNUJqjfjo4OeoDA/_IVPgDTJQty0LzGsMYyPLzUsM1bw62N8c&oid=1384835319&tid=1077&nid=11476&e=.jpg\"></p><div data-page-id=\"GwnJdNlmwo1d0px8bTzccZWjnFb\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\"><p>青春不散场，逐梦再出发。此次毕业典礼既是2026届学子校园求学时光的圆满终点，更是他们奔赴山海、逐梦远航的全新起点。愿全体毕业生带着母校的殷殷期许、师长的真挚祝福与同窗的美好情谊，始终秉持校训精神，坚守初心、笃行不怠，不负韶华、砥砺前行，在各行各业的广阔舞台上发光发热，书写精彩璀璨的人生篇章。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=9UmfA2M7LDL4CZM17M2Mz9